{"id":"fe7a8e5db6f59cf9","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-tree-binary-choice.md","title":"死子树搜索给出部分二值选枝程序","display":"lem-tree-binary-choice — 死子树搜索给出部分二值选枝程序","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-tree-binary-choice","aliases":["20-lem-tree-binary-choice"],"display":"lem-tree-binary-choice — 死子树搜索给出部分二值选枝程序","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3(iv)⇒(v)","source_printed_pages":[186],"source_pdf_pages":[218],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-extendible]]","[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-tree-binary-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-tree-binary-choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-tree-binary-choice — 死子树搜索给出部分二值选枝程序"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3(iv)⇒(v)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>186</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\omega\\to2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(h:\\omega\\to2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为固定可计算双射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=h(e)\">\\(\\sigma=h(e)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\)</span> 为直接上游定义的任意长可延伸节点集合；未找到空层时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_e\">\\(n_e\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_T(e)\">\\(\\psi_T(e)\\)</span> 均未定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tree-binary-choice}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD_T(\\sigma,b,n)\\Longleftrightarrow n&gt;|\\sigma|\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in T\\ [|\\tau|=n\\land\\sigma^\\frown b\\preceq\\tau],\\\\\n\\psi_T(e)\\simeq1-\\min\\{b&lt;2:D_T(h(e),b,n_e)\\},\\\\\nn_e:=\\mu n\\ \\exists b&lt;2\\ D_T(h(e),b,n),\\\\\n\\psi_T\\in\\mathcal C_1\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\psi_T)\\subseteq2,\\\\\nh(e)\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\land\\psi_T(e)\\downarrow=b\n\\Rightarrow h(e)^\\frown b\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tree-binary-choice}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD_T(\\sigma,b,n)\\Longleftrightarrow n&gt;|\\sigma|\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in T\\ [|\\tau|=n\\land\\sigma^\\frown b\\preceq\\tau],\\\\\n\\psi_T(e)\\simeq1-\\min\\{b&lt;2:D_T(h(e),b,n_e)\\},\\\\\nn_e:=\\mu n\\ \\exists b&lt;2\\ D_T(h(e),b,n),\\\\\n\\psi_T\\in\\mathcal C_1\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\psi_T)\\subseteq2,\\\\\nh(e)\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\land\\psi_T(e)\\downarrow=b\n\\Rightarrow h(e)^\\frown b\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对固定层，二进制串的检查是有限的；找到首次空层即选另一边。若父节点可延伸，不可能两边都死，所以该选择正确；若两边都可延伸，程序一直发散，任意二值延伸均可选择。对无延伸的父节点采用确定的先后规则，仍保证部分函数单值。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3(iv)⇒(v)；印刷页 186；PDF 第 218 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\omega\\to2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=h(e)","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"n_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_T(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tree-binary-choice}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD_T(\\sigma,b,n)\\Longleftrightarrow n>|\\sigma|\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in T\\ [|\\tau|=n\\land\\sigma^\\frown b\\preceq\\tau],\\\\\n\\psi_T(e)\\simeq1-\\min\\{b<2:D_T(h(e),b,n_e)\\},\\\\\nn_e:=\\mu n\\ \\exists b<2\\ D_T(h(e),b,n),\\\\\n\\psi_T\\in\\mathcal C_1\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\psi_T)\\subseteq2,\\\\\nh(e)\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\land\\psi_T(e)\\downarrow=b\n\\Rightarrow h(e)^\\frown b\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1856,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1cda67d4ddf93f2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-lem-tree-binary-choice]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"}],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","8705fb72e379b21a","755e421576224435"]}